<title>FINLAND: Finnish May export prices fall 4.6 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 05:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Finnish May export prices fall 4.6 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 05:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to &quot;fell&quot; from &quot;rose&quot; in headline and throughout, and in tabular information)</p>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 4.6 percent year-on-year in May and they were flat on April, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated import prices rose 0.5 percent year-on-year in May and they rose 1.3 percent month-on-month, SF said in a statement.</p>
<p>(Export prices:)</p>
<p>		 May 1997	 April 1997	 May 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     +/-0 pct	   +0.6 pct	 -0.5 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 -4.6 pct	   -5.1 pct	 +2.5 pct</p>
<p>(Import prices:)</p>
<p>		 May 1997	 April 1997	 May 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     +0.5 pct	   -0.3 pct	 -0.4 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 +1.3 pct	   -1.2 pct	 +1.3 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
